    <section class="sec sec--split" id="confidence" data-rl>
      <div class="rl-copy">
        <span class="sec-eyebrow">Confidence beyond Shannon</span>
        <h2>Pre-fusion normalized hesitation, prior gate modes, and wide-option routing.</h2>
        <p>
          Raw Shannon entropy (<code>H = -∑ p_i ln p_i</code>) scales with option count <code>ln K</code>: a 2-option boolean gate maxes out at <code>0.693 nats</code> while a 26-option taxonomy choice reaches <code>3.258 nats</code>. <strong>dgem</strong> normalizes hesitation onto <code>[0, 1]</code> via <code>raw_normalized_entropy = H / ln K</code>, gates Stage 2 cascades strictly on <strong>pre-fusion</strong> hesitation, and fuses empirical priors with <code>decisionindex.FusePriorWithGateMode</code>.
        </p>
        <ul class="rl-points">
          <li><strong>Three intuitive hesitation bands</strong> — <code>&lt; 16% Clear</code> (fast-path return), <code>16–50% Somewhat unsure</code>, and <code>&gt; 50% Very unsure</code> across any <code>K</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Always gate on pre-fusion <code>raw_normalized_entropy</code></strong> — a strong wrong prior depresses post-fusion <code>normalized_entropy</code> and collapses error-detection AUROC. Keep cascade gates on <code>raw_normalized_entropy</code> and fuse priors with <code>--prior-gate-mode hesitant</code> or <code>proportional</code> (<code>decisionindex.FusePriorWithGateMode</code> / <code>decisionindex.NormalizeCosinePriorLogits</code>).</li>
          <li><strong>Wide-option routing (<code>K &gt; 26</code>)</strong> — route large option catalogs via <code>--bracket-size 20</code> (default two-stage bracket tournament), <code>--shortlist-topk M</code> (<code>decisionindex.PriorLogitsShortlist</code> / <code>decisionindex.LexicalOverlapShortlist</code>), or <code>--labels az_aa</code> / <code>az_lower</code> (up to 52 options).</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="rl-cta">
